</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/df0133f8-84ee-11f1-8fec-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26196667755408.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/df0133f8-84ee-11f1-8fec-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26196667755408.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">2c8980e0-8769-11f1-9460-e72f0f9713f6</guid><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 14:08:51 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/df0133f8-84ee-11f1-8fec-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26196667755408.jpg">AP Photo/Alex Brandon - Alex Brandon</source><dc:creator>罗拉</dc:creator></item><item><category>中国</category><title>中国证监会原副主席方星海官宣被查</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/20260724-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E8%AF%81%E7%9B%91%E4%BC%9A%E5%8E%9F%E5%89%AF%E4%B8%BB%E5%B8%AD%E6%96%B9%E6%98%9F%E6%B5%B7%E5%AE%98%E5%AE%A3%E8%A2%AB%E6%9F%A5</link><description>
